  "body": "Ground-level ease in the heart of Millwater\r\n\r\nWhether you’re retiring, downsizing, buying your first home or adding to your portfolio, this modern two-bedroom ground-floor apartment ticks the boxes.\r\n\r\nEasy living: Built in 2016, this approx. 68 m² apartment has no stairs, and its flat, easy access suits retirees and downsizers wanting a step-free home. The open-plan kitchen, dining and living area flows to outdoor space at both the front and the back, with both bedrooms a comfortable size. Your own carport, generous street parking, and extra storage keep everything tidy. A well-run body corporate looks after the grounds, so it’s genuine lock-up-and-leave living.\r\n\r\nFirst home: It’s a quality, low-maintenance place to start out in one of the Coast’s most popular neighbourhoods. It’s zoned for Silverdale School and Orewa College (buyers to confirm), and Kingsway School is close by.\r\n\r\nInvestors: It’s currently rented, and the tenants are keen to stay on, giving you income from day one.\r\n\r\nThe lifestyle: A park and a daycare are right across the road. Millwater’s walkways, cycle trails, reserves and sports grounds on Millwater Parkway are on your doorstep. Pop down to the Millwater shops for a coffee at the ever-popular Millie’s Café, or head to Silverdale Mall for shopping, supermarkets and amenities. Orewa town centre and the beautiful Orewa Beach are just a short drive away, and the Hibiscus Coast busway and motorway put the city within easy reach.\r\n\r\nGround-level homes in Millwater are hard to find. Call today to arrange a viewing.",
